# Product Owner reviews

When the user asks for **PO**, **product owner**, **aceitação**, **go/no-go**, **revisão de plano/tasks/implementação/submission**, or `/po-legislative-review`:

1. Read and follow `.cursor/skills/po-legislative-review/SKILL.md` (and `reference.md`).
2. Produce the PO Report template (verdict + FR/SC coverage).
3. Do not start implementing fixes unless the user explicitly asks after the review.

Challenge feature of record: `specs/001-legislative-vote-reports/`.
